WEBVTT

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.360
Accused!

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:31.281
As you are well aware,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:37.120
this spell is created from the power
of an evil spirit from ancient times.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:42.625
If you fail against Dark Schneider,
or decide to join his side,

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:46.463
this nail will change colors
from blue to purple.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:50.383
Eventually, it will turn red,
and then you will be--

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.303
I know the spell. Hurry up and just do it.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.138
Very well.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.390
Hold out your right finger.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.646
Kings of splatter rock,

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:07.400
I demand you come forth
on the wings of a bat.

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:11.988
Demon of the night,
enter my nail and seal our pact!

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.948
Accused!

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:24.209
The ritual is complete.

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:26.628
Every time you look at your blue nail,

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.380
you will be reminded of the spell.

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:31.132
Don't forget it.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.553
This ridiculous spell
doesn't make any difference to me.

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:38.306
I would have happily killed him
with or without it.

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:40.266
That's good to hear.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.687
It would be a waste to have someone
as beautiful as you turned into a toad.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.689
So are we done here?

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.108
I've got work to do.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.412
Don't you think
you're overdoing it, Abigail?

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:28.583
You don't honestly believe
that Nei could betray us as well?

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:31.002
The love
that half-elf has for Dark Schneider

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:34.130
is like the love a child has
for it's father.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:38.593
Stronger still, the woman lived
with him for over 100 years.

00:03:38.676 --> 00:03:41.846
Out of all of us, she was closest to him.

00:03:42.931 --> 00:03:43.932
Hmm.

00:03:44.015 --> 00:03:46.226
Kall-Su, I must ask.

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:49.395
What do you think
about Dark Schneider's recent activities?

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.856
They don't make much sense.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.610
The Dark Schneider I know
would have killed all his enemies.

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:57.737
He was a cold-blooded demon.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:00.531
He would have never shown mercy
to anyone he defeated.

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:02.158
Let alone his own men.

00:04:02.867 --> 00:04:04.661
But for some unknown reason,

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:08.039
he didn't kill Gara
or the Three Sorcerer Generals.

00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:10.041
He got them to join his side.

00:04:10.124 --> 00:04:11.084
Yes.

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:16.005
It appears he's become a completely
different person over the last 15 years.

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:19.008
<i>Dark Schneider,</i>
<i>you were my friend.</i>

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:21.177
<i>The one I looked up to the most.</i>

00:04:21.719 --> 00:04:24.389
<i>What could have happened</i>
<i>in the last 15 years</i>

00:04:24.472 --> 00:04:26.057
<i>to change you so much?</i>

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:29.602
Regardless,
there is one thing we must consider.

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.815
Dark Schneider poses our greatest threat.

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:35.525
He is doing everything he can

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:38.111
to prevent us
from building our ideal world.

00:04:40.029 --> 00:04:41.572
He's dangerous.

00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:44.033
One of the strongest sorcerers.

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:47.453
We must hurry
and do whatever we can to kill him!

00:04:48.037 --> 00:04:51.207
When the God of Destruction,
Anthrasax returns,

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:53.793
it will bring about the ultimate paradise.

00:04:53.876 --> 00:04:59.924
A place without war, discrimination,
or poverty, ruled only by magic!

00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:01.759
A perfect utopia!

00:05:01.843 --> 00:05:04.178
The Sorcerer Kingdom!

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.723
Take a look, Kall-Su.

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:12.020
The first stages of Anthrasax's
reawakening has already started.

00:05:13.271 --> 00:05:15.523
Together we must break the second,

00:05:15.606 --> 00:05:19.819
the third, and the fourth seal
as soon as we possibly can.

00:05:19.902 --> 00:05:20.945
You're right.

00:05:21.029 --> 00:05:24.532
We must act quickly to expand
the main force of the Dark Rebel Army,

00:05:24.615 --> 00:05:27.410
including my first army
and your second army.

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:30.246
While Nei distracts Dark Schneider,

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.291
we must take the seals
from the other royal families.

00:05:36.252 --> 00:05:40.131
Dark Schneider and Arshes Nei
are an interesting combination.

00:05:40.214 --> 00:05:42.300
We got quite lucky with this.

00:05:42.383 --> 00:05:46.095
However, it makes no difference to us
who wins between the two.

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:47.472
Kall-Su,

00:05:47.555 --> 00:05:51.684
as you and Nei both know, there are rules
to being able to break the Accused spell.

00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:53.394
She will only be able to escape

00:05:53.478 --> 00:05:56.064
if she can get her hands
on a certain item.

00:05:56.147 --> 00:05:57.732
<i>To break the curse,</i>

00:05:57.815 --> 00:06:01.486
<i>she'll need to get her hands</i>
<i>on the fresh heart of the spell's target.</i>

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.244
<i>So you see,</i>

00:06:10.328 --> 00:06:14.415
<i>the only way Arshes Nei</i>
<i>can save herself from this curse,</i>

00:06:14.499 --> 00:06:18.503
<i>is if she rips out Dark Schneider's heart</i>
<i>while it's still beating.</i>

00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:26.552
Even if Nei plans
on switching sides to be with him,

00:06:26.636 --> 00:06:29.305
the spell I've cast
will eliminate her immediately.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:33.059
If Dark Schneider wants
to save his beloved Nei,

00:06:33.142 --> 00:06:36.396
he will only be able to
if he sacrifices himself.

00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:37.397
And what's more,

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.316
since the two of them
use the same type of magic,

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.026
they could destroy each other!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:46.155
<i>If they clash head-on, one of them,</i>
<i>or perhaps both of them,</i>

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:48.324
<i>could vanish from this world.</i>

00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:54.831
No matter what the outcome,
it will end in our favor.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:07:00.795
<i>I don't know if you realize</i>
<i>you've made a losing bet,</i>

00:07:01.295 --> 00:07:02.338
<i>Arshes Nei.</i>

00:07:07.218 --> 00:07:09.846
Miss Yoko!
The preparations are complete!

00:07:11.013 --> 00:07:13.933
Thank you! Just hold on a sec!

00:07:14.016 --> 00:07:14.934
Hmm.

00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.481
Dark Schneider.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.110
Come on, sweetheart.

00:07:24.193 --> 00:07:25.903
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:25.987 --> 00:07:28.364
Don't ruin your cute face.

00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:32.827
You know, the Temple of Cant is only
a half a day away from here by carriage.

00:07:33.411 --> 00:07:36.789
And it's also close
to the battle in Meta-llicana.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.419
Take care of yourself.

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:43.713
Goodbye, Sean Ari.

00:07:43.796 --> 00:07:47.508
Hopefully, Kai will get better
once she's treated at the temple.

00:07:47.592 --> 00:07:48.676
Don't worry.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:52.472
I am grateful, Tia Noto Yoko.

00:07:53.264 --> 00:07:56.392
I know you're strong
because Di-amon could not beat you.

00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:58.311
I won't tell you what to do,

00:07:58.394 --> 00:08:02.899
but I think you should know
that out of all of the Four Divine Kings,

00:08:02.982 --> 00:08:06.027
Nei, the Empress of Thunder,
is the most powerful.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.361
Please don't forget that.

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:09.489
Right. I got it.

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:11.199
Now go.

00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:18.664
<i> Dark Schneider.</i>

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:21.125
<i>Please help Empress Nei.</i>

00:08:30.426 --> 00:08:35.848
<i>You know, I always knew</i>
<i>that he never felt the same way as I did.</i>

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.685
<i>He never called me by my name.</i>

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.271
<i>Not even once.</i>

00:08:43.272 --> 00:08:46.567
You don't have to act like such a bastard!
<i>You know, that was really mean.</i>

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:49.195
<i>Yoko is wonderful.</i>

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:54.450
<i>But I hope you don't forget me,</i>

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:55.993
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:00.081
<i>I love you.</i>

00:09:04.252 --> 00:09:05.753
There she goes.

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:08.422
I thought she was a really sweet girl.

00:09:08.506 --> 00:09:10.091
You think so, huh?

00:09:10.174 --> 00:09:11.342
Hey, Lucien…

00:09:11.425 --> 00:09:12.802
I mean, Dark Schneider.

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:14.762
As your friend, I need to warn you.

00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:19.517
Don't you dare be the type
who's unfaithful and makes girls cry!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.686
Don't forget you're the main character!

00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:24.355
What's this?
You wanna be the leading lady?

00:09:24.981 --> 00:09:27.567
Are you jealous?

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.902
All right! Let's go!

00:09:29.986 --> 00:09:31.696
We are on our way home!

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:42.707
What's that?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.417
It's Gara's wyvern!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.127
Now, take this!

00:09:49.672 --> 00:09:51.549
Follow Master Gara!

00:09:51.632 --> 00:09:53.301
Go, Gara!

00:09:55.886 --> 00:09:59.390
You goblins are too weak
to defeat Ninja Master Gara.

00:09:59.473 --> 00:10:00.474
What?

00:10:01.892 --> 00:10:02.852
Lightning?

00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:06.272
It's a griffin!

00:10:06.355 --> 00:10:07.982
I've never seen
anything like it!

00:10:18.701 --> 00:10:21.329
Nice to see you, Arshes Nei!

00:10:21.954 --> 00:10:24.332
Gara, I want to know the truth.

00:10:24.415 --> 00:10:26.792
Why did you betray the Four Divine Kings?

00:10:26.876 --> 00:10:29.378
Well, that's an easy one.

00:10:29.462 --> 00:10:34.634
I joined forces with Dark Schneider
'cause he's way more fun! Ha!

00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:36.594
You imbecile!

00:10:36.677 --> 00:10:37.637
Die!

00:10:45.936 --> 00:10:48.564
You don't deserve
the title of "Ninja Master."

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:50.983
You were once part
of the Four Divine Kings,

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:54.820
working with us to finally unseal
our demon god, Anthrasax!

00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:57.323
But now you fight for our greatest enemy!

00:10:57.406 --> 00:10:58.449
Ha!

00:10:58.532 --> 00:11:01.327
Did you learn how
to talk like that from Kall-Su!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.828
You know what I think?

00:11:02.912 --> 00:11:06.123
I think you wish you could join up
with Dark Schneider as well.

00:11:06.207 --> 00:11:07.458
I know you do.

00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:09.168
You know nothing!

00:11:10.336 --> 00:11:11.379
Lightning Sword!

00:11:11.962 --> 00:11:13.297
That sword!

00:11:14.465 --> 00:11:16.258
Murasame Blade!

00:11:28.729 --> 00:11:31.774
Well done
surviving a strike from the Raijinken.

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:34.235
The Murasame Blade is an impressive sword.

00:11:34.318 --> 00:11:35.361
Indeed.

00:11:35.444 --> 00:11:37.697
And you too have an interesting toy.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.866
This is the first time I've had
the pleasure of seeing it in person.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.869
Look.
That sword is covered in lightning!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.831
No way.
It's that legendary sword.

00:11:46.914 --> 00:11:48.582
It's gotta be the Raijinken.

00:11:49.875 --> 00:11:52.670
They say it's
as powerful as the Fire Sword.

00:11:53.546 --> 00:11:57.758
They say if the wielder is strong enough,
it can even split a mountain!

00:11:57.842 --> 00:12:01.679
So she does wield
the legendary Raijinken sword.

00:12:01.762 --> 00:12:04.223
And it's just as powerful as I have heard.

00:12:04.306 --> 00:12:06.642
<i>The Murasame Blade survived that attack,</i>

00:12:06.726 --> 00:12:09.186
<i>but any normal sword</i>
<i>would have snapped in two.</i>

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:12.982
They say that flimsy sword of yours
could split a mountain.

00:12:14.275 --> 00:12:15.735
And you doubt it?

00:12:15.818 --> 00:12:16.819
Just you watch!

00:12:21.157 --> 00:12:22.116
Knives?

00:12:24.368 --> 00:12:25.578
You'll need more than that!

00:12:25.661 --> 00:12:28.205
All right. What about this?

00:12:30.708 --> 00:12:31.751
Gotcha!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:33.794
Damn!

00:12:38.799 --> 00:12:41.177
-That's it!
-It's Gara's special move!

00:12:41.969 --> 00:12:43.888
Majinken!

00:12:48.642 --> 00:12:50.603
He did it! He cut her in two!

00:12:50.686 --> 00:12:52.980
He even moved
around the griffin and the wyvern.

00:12:53.063 --> 00:12:54.815
Master Gara is amazing!

00:12:56.108 --> 00:12:59.570
Too easy.
Something's not right. I can feel it.

00:13:00.988 --> 00:13:03.157
What? An illusion?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.787
It's over for you!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.457
My Secret Hariken Style attack
will send you to your grave!

00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:16.629
Dragon Blast Demon Slash!

00:13:22.092 --> 00:13:23.969
Master Gara!

00:13:27.556 --> 00:13:31.268
Master Gara! Master Gara!

00:13:39.568 --> 00:13:41.278
She split the bridge.

00:13:41.362 --> 00:13:44.573
I don't believe it.
This is a nightmare.

00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:46.492
Master Gara!

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:50.454
Incredible.

00:13:50.538 --> 00:13:53.249
What incredible power this sword has.

00:13:53.332 --> 00:13:55.209
As long as I have Raijinken,

00:13:55.292 --> 00:13:57.586
no one will be able to stop me.

00:13:58.087 --> 00:14:01.340
I have no reason to fear Dark Schneider.

00:14:04.593 --> 00:14:07.930
Wow!
Raijinken is compatible with your power.

00:14:08.013 --> 00:14:10.266
I could feel it's energy growing.

00:14:10.349 --> 00:14:11.392
Damn you!

00:14:18.941 --> 00:14:20.568
Whoa! It's Master Gara!

00:14:20.651 --> 00:14:21.777
He's alive!

00:14:21.861 --> 00:14:22.903
And look!

00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:25.030
There's more than one!

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.782
Which is the real one?

00:14:26.866 --> 00:14:29.243
Just what kind of trick is this?

00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:32.204
Ninja Seven Body Split technique!

00:14:34.248 --> 00:14:36.125
You just killed one of my copies.

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:38.085
Couldn't you tell it wasn't real?

00:14:38.168 --> 00:14:39.795
I've got a question.

00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:41.505
Since we split up…

00:14:41.589 --> 00:14:43.465
Can you figure it out…?

00:14:43.549 --> 00:14:45.175
Which one the seven…

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.970
Is the real one?

00:14:48.971 --> 00:14:51.849
He played me by using his ninja art.

00:14:53.392 --> 00:14:56.854
Back then you were known
as Dark Schneider's lover, weren't you?

00:14:56.937 --> 00:15:00.024
I always assumed
at some point you'd switch sides.

00:15:00.107 --> 00:15:03.027
But no.
Instead, you're fighting against him.

00:15:07.531 --> 00:15:10.034
It looks like you're ready
to fight for real.

00:15:11.118 --> 00:15:12.661
Let's do this.

00:15:12.745 --> 00:15:15.539
-What's he doing?
-He took off his armor!

00:15:15.623 --> 00:15:17.249
Very astute.

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:20.753
So you understand your armor
is useless against my weapon.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.421
It's no matter.

00:15:22.504 --> 00:15:25.466
I'll send you to hell
with my next strike anyway!

00:15:26.467 --> 00:15:29.637
The strongest swordsman
of the Four Divine Kings.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.931
Nei, I accept your challenge.

00:15:32.431 --> 00:15:34.350
Can you stop my ninja sword?

00:15:35.267 --> 00:15:37.645
What? What kind of stance is that?

00:15:37.728 --> 00:15:38.896
That's…

00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:41.857
That pose!
It's Master Gara's most powerful move!

00:15:46.278 --> 00:15:47.905
Murasame!

00:15:48.656 --> 00:15:51.033
Go, True Majinken!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.372
It can't be.

00:15:57.039 --> 00:15:58.666
It's a sonic boom!

00:15:58.749 --> 00:16:01.669
Master Gara's sword
moves faster than the speed of sound!

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:05.005
<i>When Gara used True Majinken</i>
<i>against Dark Schneider,</i>

00:16:05.089 --> 00:16:06.382
<i>he was only using one arm.</i>

00:16:06.465 --> 00:16:10.177
But this time he did the attack perfectly!

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.263
And the seven copies
are attacking at the same time!

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:16.892
It's over for her.
No one can survive that attack!

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:19.561
The Empress of Thunder is done!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.273
The Seven Body Split technique.

00:16:24.441 --> 00:16:27.987
It's an illusion created
by high-speed intermittent movement.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.822
Only one of them is real.

00:16:30.322 --> 00:16:32.157
Even if he is a Ninja Master,

00:16:32.241 --> 00:16:35.703
he can't shoot six True Majinken
at the same time.

00:16:35.786 --> 00:16:37.454
There's only one coming for me.

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:38.539
I can see it.

00:16:40.624 --> 00:16:42.876
-Now!
-What's this?

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.629
I saw it! True Majinken!

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:52.594
<i>I don't believe it.</i>
<i>She blocked from such a close range!</i>

00:16:52.678 --> 00:16:55.556
<i>Six copies unleashed the attack</i>
<i>at the same time,</i>

00:16:55.639 --> 00:16:57.266
<i>but she found the real one.</i>

00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:58.934
You're finished, Gara.

00:16:59.018 --> 00:17:00.561
Any last words?

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:03.313
What? What is this?

00:17:04.148 --> 00:17:06.191
The Raijinken is cracking!

00:17:24.334 --> 00:17:25.169
Whoa!

00:17:25.252 --> 00:17:27.963
Look! The Empress' sword broke!

00:17:29.673 --> 00:17:30.924
My Raijinken.

00:17:31.508 --> 00:17:32.468
No way.

00:17:33.302 --> 00:17:36.346
The True Majinken.
What a formidable sword!

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.182
Oh, isn't it?

00:17:39.433 --> 00:17:41.727
I think I'm the winner, Nei.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.979
You can't fight with a broken sword.

00:17:45.898 --> 00:17:47.649
You don't have to worry though.

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:50.611
I know how very important you are
to Dark Schneider,

00:17:50.694 --> 00:17:52.321
so I'm not gonna kill you.

00:17:54.198 --> 00:17:55.115
He did it!

00:17:55.199 --> 00:17:57.701
Master Gara
and the 2,000-strong ninja army

00:17:57.785 --> 00:18:01.663
have beat the 20,000-strong
Third Army of the Four Divine Kings!

00:18:02.247 --> 00:18:05.959
I can't believe
our Empress lost to Gara!

00:18:06.043 --> 00:18:07.711
No… no way.

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:19.556
We did it! We saved Princess Sheila!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:23.102
Ninja Master Gara
defeated the enemy for us!

00:18:24.561 --> 00:18:25.896
I'm glad!

00:18:25.979 --> 00:18:28.273
Meta-llicana has been rescued!

00:18:28.357 --> 00:18:29.441
Isn't that great?

00:18:29.525 --> 00:18:31.568
Yes. We're safe for now.

00:18:31.652 --> 00:18:35.656
But we still need to keep the second seal
away from the evil Goddess.

00:18:36.824 --> 00:18:38.992
Thank you, Gara.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.246
But don't you find it curious?

00:18:42.329 --> 00:18:46.166
Why would a ninja like Gara
choose to fight for us this time?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.418
Do you have any thoughts, Master Geo?

00:18:48.502 --> 00:18:49.336
I don't.

00:18:49.419 --> 00:18:53.340
It could be the groups
are fighting among themselves.

00:18:53.423 --> 00:18:55.968
I bet he betrayed the others for money.

00:18:56.051 --> 00:18:58.428
The ninja is nothing but a poor fool.

00:19:00.848 --> 00:19:01.765
Uh…

00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:04.726
<i>Could this mean that he was…</i>

00:19:07.479 --> 00:19:09.022
Gara, you scum.

00:19:09.565 --> 00:19:11.859
You wield such a powerful sword,

00:19:11.942 --> 00:19:15.904
but you and Dark Schneider have turned
into dogs for the royal family.

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:19.575
How dare you try to stop us
from creating our perfect world.

00:19:21.368 --> 00:19:22.828
You're such a fool.

00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:25.622
Let me explain.

00:19:25.706 --> 00:19:28.458
I care nothing about the fake utopia

00:19:28.542 --> 00:19:30.961
Kall-Su and the others
are always going on about.

00:19:31.962 --> 00:19:32.921
Listen.

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.841
All I want is to have a little fun.

00:19:39.595 --> 00:19:41.305
You bastard!

00:19:41.388 --> 00:19:42.472
Bullets of light!

00:19:43.682 --> 00:19:46.059
What? Nei is going to fight?

00:19:46.143 --> 00:19:47.060
No way!

00:19:47.144 --> 00:19:49.271
Wait. Is that…?

00:19:49.354 --> 00:19:51.231
Are those magic missiles?

00:19:51.315 --> 00:19:52.566
Anthem!

00:19:54.401 --> 00:19:55.736
Give up, Nei!

00:19:56.528 --> 00:19:59.281
No way you can beat me with this magic!

00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:03.285
My turn, Gara!

00:20:03.785 --> 00:20:05.245
I said stop it!

00:20:05.329 --> 00:20:07.206
You can't fight with a broken sword!

00:20:07.289 --> 00:20:08.373
You'll get killed!

00:20:11.668 --> 00:20:13.253
Whoa! What's that?

00:20:13.754 --> 00:20:15.380
No way!

00:20:15.464 --> 00:20:18.342
Raijinken doesn't cut
with its steel blade.

00:20:19.927 --> 00:20:23.096
Witness the secret
behind the sword that splits mountains.

00:20:26.099 --> 00:20:30.229
Haouken Secret Thunder Claw Blade Strike!

00:20:36.401 --> 00:20:37.486
What?

00:20:42.699 --> 00:20:44.451
Master Gara! Master Gara!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.205
<i>That's impossible.</i>

00:20:48.288 --> 00:20:51.041
<i>The lightning sword</i>
<i>went right through Murasame!</i>

00:20:54.836 --> 00:20:56.129
Now you know.

00:20:56.213 --> 00:20:58.590
It's the lightning that forms the blade.

00:20:58.674 --> 00:21:01.510
That's how it's capable
of splitting mountains.

00:21:03.553 --> 00:21:06.765
It's impossible for any sword to block it.

00:21:08.475 --> 00:21:11.395
And soon it'll end your life.

00:21:11.478 --> 00:21:13.772
<i>Ah, dammit. This isn't good.</i>

00:21:13.855 --> 00:21:15.190
<i>I'm in a bad spot.</i>

00:21:15.691 --> 00:21:16.817
Master Gara!

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:22.614
After I finish you, your friend's next.

00:21:23.115 --> 00:21:26.743
Do you really think you can kill him?

00:21:26.827 --> 00:21:27.744
Of course!

00:21:28.412 --> 00:21:30.956
After all, it's for our perfect world.

00:21:31.039 --> 00:21:33.083
Our perfect Sorcerer Kingdom.

00:21:36.503 --> 00:21:38.839
<i>Help us. Please…</i>

00:21:39.339 --> 00:21:41.466
And now you die!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.135
<i>…Dark Schneider!</i>

00:21:52.561 --> 00:21:54.396
What's that?

00:21:54.479 --> 00:21:56.315
Ugh. So close.

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.859
I was about to get burned to a crisp.

00:21:58.942 --> 00:22:03.947
Great Priest, do you see him
over on the other side of the river?

00:22:05.741 --> 00:22:06.992
Is that…

00:22:07.075 --> 00:22:08.201
Huh?

00:22:09.411 --> 00:22:10.829
Could it be…?

00:22:17.878 --> 00:22:19.379
Dark Schneider!
